    "Scouting Notes": "Starter\n Has been really solid since the start of June 2022.\n Leans very heavily on his fastball, which has good ride from a low arm slot and can reach 96 MPH. Really solid pitch, plus.\n None of the secondaries are great, but they all flash at times.\n I believe the most in the slider. The curve and change do have some flashes of good depth, but seems the least consistent.\n He works his slider away from righties and down and in at the back foot of left handed hitters.\n Ceiling of a Mike Fiers type pitcher with a little more velo (just gets the job done).",
